    "description": "Discover a new application for your most personalized skincare experience yet. Complete a 4-minute Skin Diagnostic and learn your exact typology. Receive personalised advice and product recommendations based on your skin and specific concerns. Watch customized video content on how and when to use your products.\r\nGet access to all our skincare products and the latest releases, along with order tracking and your favorites. Want to take it a step further? Subscribe to Typology Premier for weekly skincare sessions with our facialist and access to exclusive content.",
